  "question": "Where is the closest hotel relative to the northwest of Eddie C. Moore Park, Clearwater, FL?",
  "sql": "SELECT P.poi_name FROM pois AS P WHERE P.tourism = 'hotel' AND degrees(ST_Azimuth( ST_Centroid((SELECT geometry FROM parks WHERE park_name ILIKE '%Eddie C. Moore Park%' LIMIT 1)), ST_Centroid(P.geometry) )) BETWEEN 292.5 AND 337.5 ORDER BY ST_Distance( P.geometry::geography, (SELECT geometry FROM parks WHERE park_name ILIKE '%Eddie C. Moore Park%' LIMIT 1)::geography ) ASC LIMIT 1;",
